[I] Freedesktop.org standard system sound theme

[T] The freedesktop.org sound theme provides a common set of event sounds (such
[T] as bell, camera shutter or trash-empty) implementing the XDG Sound Theme
[T] Specification, for use by GNOME and other desktop environments.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/xdg-sound-theme

